OL,3,ANew York building collapse kills at
OL,4,Aleast two, officials say
OL,5,
OL,6,FAuthorities are yet to determine what
OL,7,Fcaused the sudden collapse at about
OL,8,F16:00 local time (21:00 GMT) on
OL,9,FWednesday.
